# Home Page Revamp and Remaining Tasks Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Revamp the home page ([src/app/page.tsx](file:///u:/automation/src/app/page.tsx)) to look better using existing components and implement remaining tasks identified in [plan/plan.mdx](file:///u:/automation/plan/plan.mdx), specifically blog pagination and image rendering.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will be reordering the home page sections. Please review the new order in the "Proposed Changes" section.

## Proposed Changes

### Content
#### [MODIFY] [homepage.mdx](file:///u:/automation/content/main/homepage.mdx)
- Add data for [Hero_3](file:///u:/automation/src/component/hero_3.tsx#3-57) and `Hero_4`.
- Improve existing copy if needed.

### Home Page
#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///u:/automation/src/app/page.tsx)
- Reorder components to:
    1. `Hero_1` (Main Hero)
    2. `LogoCloud` (Social Proof)
    3. `Feature` (Key Features)
    4. `Hero_2` (Infrastructure Highlight)
    5. `UseCaseCard` (Industries)
    6. `Stats` (Numbers)
    7. [Hero_3](file:///u:/automation/src/component/hero_3.tsx#3-57) (Feature Highlight)
    8. `HomeCaseSection` (Case Studies)
    9. `Hero_4` (Another Highlight or CTA)
    10. `HomeBlogSection` (Latest News)
    11. `Steps` (How it works)
    12. `ForWhom` (Target Audience)
    13. `Subscribe` (CTA)
- Ensure all components receive correct props from `HomeData`.

### Components
#### [MODIFY] [universal_card.tsx](file:///u:/automation/src/component/universal_card.tsx)
- Uncomment image rendering code.
- Ensure `blog.image` is correctly used.

### Blog Pagination
#### [MODIFY] [src/app/blogs/page/[page]/page.tsx](file:///u:/automation/src/app/blogs/page/[page]/page.tsx)
- Implement [generateStaticParams](file:///u:/automation/src/app/blogs/page/%5Bpage%5D/page.tsx#8-16) for static generation of pages.
- Implement the page component to slice `getAllBlogs()` based on `params.page`.
- Render `HomeBlogSection` (or a new `BlogList` component if preferred, but `HomeBlogSection` seems to be the one used) with the sliced data.
- Add [Pagination](file:///u:/automation/src/component/pagination.tsx#12-117) component at the bottom.

#### [MODIFY] [src/app/blogs/page.tsx](file:///u:/automation/src/app/blogs/page.tsx)
- Redirect to `/blogs/page/1` OR render the same content as page 1. Redirect is often cleaner for canonical URLs, but rendering directly is also fine. I'll likely render the component directly to avoid redirect flicker, or just import the page component.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- None available for UI layout.

### Manual Verification
1.  **Home Page**:
    - Open `http://localhost:3000/`
    - Verify the new order of sections.
    - Verify [Hero_3](file:///u:/automation/src/component/hero_3.tsx#3-57) and `Hero_4` are rendered with correct data.
    - Check responsiveness.

2.  **Blog Page**:
    - Open `http://localhost:3000/blogs` (should show page 1).
    - Open `http://localhost:3000/blogs/page/1`.
    - Click "Next" -> `http://localhost:3000/blogs/page/2`.
    - Verify different blogs are shown.
    - Verify images are visible in blog cards.
